"7.5×10\", 9×12\"<p><b>4:5</b>: 20×25cm, 40×50cm, 8×10\", 16×20\"<p><b>5:7</"
"b>: 15×21cm, 30×42cm, 5×7\"<p><b>7:10</b>: 21×30cm, 42×60cm<p>The <b>Tỷ lệ "
